<%#
Cistergraphia Decode Form
=========================

Purpose:
- Turns an SVG generated by this app back into its message

Design Decisions:
- Accepts either a file upload or pasted SVG code (upload wins when both are sent)

Constraints:
- Only SVGs generated by Cistergraphia can be decoded
- Posts to /decode endpoint
%>
<form method="post" action="/decode" enctype="multipart/form-data">
  <label for="file">Upload a Cistergraphia SVG:</label><br>
  <input type="file" id="file" name="file" accept=".svg,image/svg+xml"><br>
  <label for="svg">…or paste its SVG code:</label><br>
  <textarea id="svg" name="svg" rows="8"></textarea><br>
  <input type="submit" value="Decode">
</form>
<a href="/">Encode a message instead</a>
